---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="How It Works — Get Your Vedic Kundali Report Online"
  description="See exactly how a Rashi Kundali report is made: enter your birth details, get a free preview instantly, then unlock your full Vedic astrology PDF report by date of birth."
>
  <div style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:2rem 0">
    <h1 style="color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:0.5rem">How Your Kundali Report Is Made</h1>
    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem">
      From your date of birth to a downloadable Vedic astrology PDF — here's exactly what
      happens at each step of getting your online kundali report, and how long it takes.
    </p>

    <div style="margin-bottom:2.5rem">
      <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem">Step 1 — Enter your birth details</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
        Give us your name, gender, exact date and time of birth, and birthplace. This is the
        only input a Vedic Kundali calculation needs — no login, no app download. If you don't
        know your exact birth time, tick the box and we'll use 12:00 PM as a reasonable default,
        though an accurate time gives more precise house and Dasha timing.
      </p>
      <img
        src="/images/how-it-works/step-2-fill-details.png"
        alt="Kundali report form — enter name, date of birth, time of birth and birthplace"
        loading="lazy"
        style="width:100%;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--color-border)"
      />
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom:2.5rem">
      <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem">Step 2 — Get your free Kundali preview instantly</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
        As soon as you submit the form, we calculate your birth chart using the Lahiri ayanamsa
        — the sidereal system used by traditional Vedic astrologers across India — and show you
        a free preview: your Lagna, Rashi, Nakshatra, key doshas, and (for the financial report)
        a snapshot of your money and career indicators. No payment is required to see this.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom:2.5rem">
      <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem">Step 3 — Unlock the full PDF report</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
        Like what you see? Pay securely via Razorpay (cards, UPI, netbanking, wallets) to unlock
        your complete report — a 40+ page, software-generated PDF covering house-by-house
        analysis, your full Dasha &amp; Antardasha timeline, doshas with remedies, and practical,
        outcome-focused guidance for money, career, marriage or health, depending on the report
        you chose.
      </p>
      <img
        src="/images/how-it-works/step-3-report-contents.png"
        alt="What's inside a Vedic Kundali PDF report — Dhan Yoga, house analysis, Dasha timeline, doshas"
        loading="lazy"
        style="width:100%;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid var(--color-border)"
      />
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom:2.5rem">
      <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem">Step 4 — Download &amp; keep it forever</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1rem">
        Your report generates automatically the moment payment is confirmed — usually within a
        couple of minutes. You can download the PDF directly, and we also email it to you so
        it's never more than a search away. Revisit it any time; there's nothing to renew.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-bottom:2.5rem">
      <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem">Why it's accurate</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8">
        Every chart is computed from precise ephemeris data using the Lahiri ayanamsa, then
        matched against classical Parashari principles — the same rules a traditional
        astrologer would apply, minus manual calculation errors. That's what makes a
        computer-generated Kundali report consistent and repeatable, report after report.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align:center;padding:2rem;background:var(--color-surface);border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:12px">
      <h2 style="color:var(--color-primary);font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:0.75rem">Ready to see your own chart?</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);margin-bottom:1.25rem">Get your free Kundali preview in under a minute — no card required.</p>
      <a href="/#pick-report" style="display:inline-block;background:var(--color-primary);color:#fff;padding:0.85rem 2rem;border-radius:8px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600">Get My Free Preview</a>
    </div>

    <p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;margin-top:1.5rem">
      Have more questions? See our <a href="/faq" style="color:var(--color-primary)">FAQ</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
